    "_string": "CTF Life Insurance Company Limited - “Parkour with Endless Possibilities” Game (the “Campaign”) Terms & Conditions\n\n1.The Campaign is organized by CTF Life Insurance Company Limited (incorporated in Bermuda with limited liability) (“CTF Life”). The Campaign closing date and time is 11:59 p.m. (Hong Kong time) on 31 August 2026 (the “Campaign Deadline”).\n2.Participants must complete the “Parkour with Endless Possibilities” game on or before the Campaign Deadline and duly submit the Digital Voucher Registration Survey (“Survey”), including their personal contact information (such as name, WeChat ID and telephone number).\nThe top 100 participants with the highest scores who have completed the Survey will receive a digital beverage voucher. The e-vouchers will be sent to eligible participants via message within four weeks after the end of the Campaign.\nCTF Life shall not be liable for any loss, damage or misplacement of the e-vouchers after issuance. Under no circumstances will lost or unused e-vouchers be reissued. In the event that the stated e-voucher is unavailable for any reason, CTF Life reserves the right to substitute them with other rewards of equivalent value and will contact eligible participants for arrangement details.\n3.The completion time of the game and the submission time of the survey shall be determined based on CTF Life’s records. Late submissions or incomplete participation will not be accepted.\n4.Participants must be 18 years of age or above.\n5.There is no limit on the number of entries. However, each participant is entitled to only one prize. CTF Life reserves the right to verify and consolidate duplicate and/or irregular entries.\n6.Participants who provide incorrect personal information or fail to meet the participation requirements will be disqualified without prior notice.\n7.By participating in the Campaign, participants are deemed to have read, understood and agreed to all content contained in the Personal Information Collection Statement, the Privacy Policy, the CTF Life’s People’s Republic of China Addendum and relevant terms and conditions (where applicable).\nIn case of any violation or dispute, CTF Life reserves the right to disqualify any participant and pursue further actions as deemed appropriate. CTF Life shall not be liable for any delay, loss, error, unidentifiable or damaged data submitted by participants due to computer, network, telephone or technical issues beyond its reasonable control. All participants shall have no objection thereto.",
